{"entryId":"1379","paragraphs":[{"sourceId":"heilprin:sefaria-warsaw:ta:1379:1","sourceSha256":"d4d38ec91706b08775daa3da106dd907d8ef0c6aab425147e2bc4210de163b71","englishSha256":"ab98ed1bb6fc86dcc010f0f0f02e0b70759840681730ae745f76ca1419009c1a","citations":[{"id":"1379:1:citation-01","he":[27,64],"en":[43,66],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Sanhedrin_5a.12"},"reference":"Sanhedrin 5a:12","assessment":"Exact Sanhedrin gives Chana and Chiyya as the sons of Abba bar Acha Karsela. The Bavli gives Rabbah bar Chana as Chiyya’s nephew. This does not independently establish the additional bar form of the received son’s name.","evidence":[{"reference":"Sanhedrin 5a:10","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Sanhedrin_5a.10"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Sanhedrin 5a:12","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Sanhedrin_5a.12"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]}],"inlineHebrew":[0],"holds":[{"raw":"אבוה דרבה בר בר חנא","reason":"Sanhedrin and Tosafot distinguish Rabbah bar Chana from Rabbah bar bar Chana, the grandson. The received entry’s double bar stays visible as its reported reading.","evidence":[{"reference":"Tosafot on Sanhedrin 5a:7:1","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Tosafot_on_Sanhedrin_5a.7.1"},"witness":"Vilna Edition"},{"reference":"Sanhedrin 5a:10","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Sanhedrin_5a.10"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Sanhedrin 5a:12","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Sanhedrin_5a.12"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]}],"notes":[{"text":"The exact Bavli supports the family relationship and Tosafot distinguishes the son from the grandson. The received double bar remains visible.","references":[],"urls":[]}],"comparisonEvidence":[{"reference":"Sanhedrin 5a:10","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Sanhedrin_5a.10"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Sanhedrin 5a:12","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Sanhedrin_5a.12"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Tosafot on Sanhedrin 5a:7:1","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Tosafot_on_Sanhedrin_5a.7.1"},"witness":"Vilna Edition"}]}],"entryEvidence":[]}
